# REQUIRES: verilator
# Widening is limited to explicit unsigned behavioral boundaries; structural named returns stay rejected.
# A mixed fixed/Boolean IfExp must retain its missing-provenance rejection.
# Native X/Z runs unconditionally; Icarus X/Z also runs when iverilog/vvp are available.
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/fixed-widening.py --repo %src --source-compiler %pycircuit_source_unit --linker %pycircuit_link --emitter %pycircuit_emit --cxx %cxx --verilator %verilator --scratch %t.dir
